  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven equation: 14 @ 9 * 3 & 3 $ 34 = ?\n\n \n \n\n **@**\n **$**\n *****\n **&**\n \n \n\n **×**\n **+**\n **÷**\n **-**\n \n \n\nNow, replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 14 × 9 ÷ 3 - 3 + 34 = ?\n\n⇒ __**14 × 9**__ ÷ 3 - 3 + 34 = ?\n\n⇒ __**126 ÷ 3**__ - 3 + 34 = ?\n\n⇒ __**42 - 3**__ + 34 = ?\n\n⇒ __**39 + 34**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**73**__.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
